{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat README.md && git status --short && ls -la'","aggregated_output":"# stories-api\n\nA small story library behind `POST /stories` (Lambda + DynamoDB table `stories`,\npartition key `slug`). `src/app.py` is the whole service: `handler()` parses\nthe request and `publish()` stores the story together with its three most\nsimilar existing stories (`similar: [{slug, score}]`), so the reader page can\nshow \"related\" without any query at read time. `logs/error.log` is the\nproduction log from the first two publishes after the deploy.\n\nTests use an in-memory table (`tests/fake_dynamo.py`) that validates items the\nway boto3 does, so no AWS account is needed. Run them with\n`python3 -m unittest discover tests` from the repo root.\ntotal 16\ndrwx------    9 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   288 Oct 20 20:51 .\ndrwxrwxrwt  246 root                 wheel  7872 Oct 20 20:51 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x   12 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   384 Oct 20 20:51 .git\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    19 Oct 20 20:51 .gitignore\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   654 Oct 20 20:51 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x    3 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    96 Oct 20 20:51 logs\ndrwxr-xr-x    5 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   160 Oct 20 20:51 notes\ndrwxr-xr-x    3 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    96 Oct 20 20:51 src\ndrwxr-xr-x    4 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   128 Oct 20 20:51 tests\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
